| actual event | source or object | target | accepted | stack size |
| --- | ---: | ---: | --- | ---: |
| old_field | 0 | 1 | true | 0 |
| remember | 0 | -1 | true | 0 |
| visit | 1 | 1 | true | 0 |
| promote | 1 | 1 | true | 0 |
